<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (This project is a representation of my musical and personal journey, which I pursued by investigating the best sounds and compositions to match my musical ideas. All of this is made concrete in compositions that have been written over the course of more than ten years to new compositions that are always tailored specifically for the musicians who created the project at the time. Numerous musicians are involved, such as the following: Beatrice Arrigoni on vocals, Cristiano Pomante and Michele Sannelli  on vibraphone, Gianluca Zanello and Sophia Tomelleri on sax, Federico Calcagno on Clarinet, Andrea Bruzzone and Stefano Grasso on drums, Stefano Zambon and Marco Rottoli on bass, Lorenzo Blardone, Filippo Rinaldo, Simone Locarni on piano.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
